    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36477" root="قيض" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَيِّضٌ</span></b>  <i>A barterer,</i> or <i>an exchanger of commodities:</i> (S, Msb:) of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَيْعِلٌ</span>. (Msb.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُمَا قَيِّضَانِ</span> <i>They two are barterers,</i> or
<i>exchangers of commodities;</i> like as you say
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيِّعَانِ</span>. (S.)

